  partName: Fuel Injector Clip
  description: The Fuel Injector Clip is a tiny, complex clip situated at the top-center-front
    of the engine, securing the fuel injector in place. Its primary function is to
    maintain a precise, stable connection between the fuel injector and the engine,
    allowing for accurate fuel delivery and efficient combustion. Notably, the clip's
    material, Material.001, is chosen for its high strength and resistance to corrosion,
    ensuring reliable fuel injector operation.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
